  data: {
    LLM: 'Try to get rid of all your cards. Save trumps for when you need them. Be careful with the Queen of Spades - you cannot get rid of her easily.\n\nCollect trumps early for the endgame. Watch what cards opponents pick up to know their holdings. Try to force opponents to pick up cards.\n\nCard counting is valuable. Time your attacks to maximize cards played. In the endgame, minimize the number of suits in your hand. Know when to lead the Queen of Spades.',
    Player: 'Try to get rid of all your cards. Save trumps for when you need them. Be careful with the Queen of Spades - you cannot get rid of her easily.\n\nCollect trumps early for the endgame. Watch what cards opponents pick up to know their holdings. Try to force opponents to pick up cards.\n\nCard counting is valuable. Time your attacks to maximize cards played. In the endgame, minimize the number of suits in your hand. Know when to lead the Queen of Spades.',
